    <Geometry x:Key="CaptureIconShapes">M2.5,4.5 L9,4.5 L9,11 L2.5,11 Z M11,10 A3.5,3.5 0 1 0 18,10 A3.5,3.5 0 1 0 11,10</Geometry>
